<title>HONG KONG: Shenzhen B shares sharply up at noon, mood cautious.</title>
<headline>Shenzhen B shares sharply up at noon, mood cautious.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shenzhen B share index rallied on Monday morning on bargain-hunting, but market sentiment remains jittery after sharp falls late last week sparked by official warnings on speculation, brokers said.</p>
<p>The B share index ended the morning at 163.58, up 4.51 points or 2.83 percent on thin turnover of HK$37.8 million.</p>
